## Services

### 1. Operational Backbone
{{SITE_NAME}} externalizes your entire back-office — general secretariat, admin, finance, and compliance — so founders and managing partners stop drowning in operational detail and start leading. Run by a team with 20+ years of law firm and SME operational experience. We become your invisible operations layer — payroll, contracts, compliance, reporting — handled with in-house rigor and external flexibility.

### 2. Transformation & Data
{{SITE_NAME}} rebuilds the systems layer — architecture, project governance, and data strategy — that transforms operational chaos into measurable clarity. Anchored in 22+ years of CGI systems consulting and academic expertise at Université Paris 1 Panthéon-Sorbonne. We design and deploy the information systems, dashboards, and governance frameworks that let you make decisions based on facts, not intuition.

### 3. Growth Engine
{{SITE_NAME}} engineers your full commercial pipeline — ICP definition, outbound sequences, acquisition funnels, and revenue metrics — so B2B revenue growth becomes systematic, not accidental. Built on proven playbooks from MerciApp, Clovis, and Datananas. We build your ICP, package your offers, set up outbound sequences, and create the metrics layer that turns pipeline into predictable revenue.

### 4. Legal Practice Ops
{{SITE_NAME}} provides purpose-built operational support for law firms where precision is non-negotiable and nothing can be improvised. Born from Anne Grosz's 8 years as Secretary General at Vatier & Associés — admin, finance, compliance, and client file management handled with law-firm precision. Partners focus on practice; we handle everything else.

